It has to do, partly, with the Castle proper being on a different submap
than the surrounding maze.  The same behavior can be observed inside the
Wizard's Tower (and can be exploited there via level teleport, which
will keep you inside the Tower if you started there; no need to wade
through the zoo anymore!)

The full explanation is a lot more detailed, but suffice it to say that
the quirks regarding submaps are sufficient that the code opted to
prevent all teleportation between submaps ("regions"), rather than try
to special-case or work around it in some way.

